# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the context-root .dockerignore.
# kubeflow/pipelines' root .dockerignore EXCLUDES .git (plus dist / node_modules /
# various component Dockerfiles). But the commit-image grader AND the air-gapped
# PATCH re-run need the FULL .git history COPYed into /mayhem (mayhem.yml checks
# out with fetch-depth 0 for exactly this). So we override here: KEEP .git and the
# harnessed sources (backend/src/v2/objectstore/config.go for the standalone
# bucketconfig mini-module; go.mod/go.sum + backend/ for the in-module FuzzExprSelect
# build of backend/src/v2/expression and its in-tree deps; mayhem/), and only drop
# the genuinely-heavy build outputs / JS trees that neither build reads.
**/node_modules
bower_components
dist
frontend/dist
backend/build
v2/build
